#: setup.php
msgid "Auto Create WMI Queries"
msgstr "Skep WMI-navrae outomaties"

#: setup.php
msgid "If selected, when running either automation, or when creating/saving a Device, all WMI Queries associated with the Device Template will be created."
msgstr "Indien gekies, wanneer outomatisering uitgevoer word of wanneer 'n Toestel geskep/gestoor word, sal alle WMI-navrae wat met die Toestelsjabloon geassosieer word, geskep word."

#: setup.php
msgid "Use WinRM over HTTPS"
msgstr "Gebruik WinRM oor HTTPS"

#: setup.php
msgid "Default for accounts that inherit server settings. Configure and trust the target certificate; certificate checks are not disabled."
msgstr "Verstek vir rekeninge wat bedienerinstellings erf. Stel die teikensertifikaat op en vertrou dit; sertifikaatkontroles word nie gedeaktiveer nie."

